# The Actions runner unpacks this repository's archive for every `$/` action, and fails on a symlink whose target is
# absent. Upstream worktrunk-scripts links CONSTITUTION-ARTICLES.md to a file its own vendored constitution lacks.
/repos/worktrunk-scripts/CONSTITUTION-ARTICLES.md export-ignore
# The vendored upstream subtrees under repos/ are 272 MB of 38,917 files that no flake, workflow or action reads. Every
# `github:systemfsoftware/systemfsoftware` flake input and every `$/` action downloads and unpacks this archive on a
# cold runner, so the subtrees stay out of it.
/repos/ export-ignore
# CONSTITUTION.md is a symlink into repos/constitution; the Actions runner fails on a symlink whose target the archive lacks.
/CONSTITUTION.md export-ignore
